    {
      "id": "17E9CBF4D004962F",
      "title": "A Victory Worth Wings",
      "description": [
        "After earning ground riding, defeat a major boss: the Wither, Ender Dragon, a Cataclysm boss, the Dead King or Echo of Tyros. The player credited with the victory unlocks this milestone for their FTB team; ordinary Apotheosis rares and the starter Oathless trial do not count."
      ],
