    {
      "id": "45BC935DA497588C",
      "title": "Companions of the Ashen Road",
      "description": [
        "Craft the in-game Mythical Mounts guide book with one normal book and one leather, in any crafting grid. Search Mythical Mounts in JEI, or right-click the crafted red book to read about taming foods, care, saddles and riding controls.",
        "Ground options include dire wolves, riding lizards, courier birds and nightmares; flying choices include griffons, dragons, giant moths, colelytras, firebirds and nether bats. Players cannot damage another player's owned mount."
